{"id":"word:hebrew:H3290","type":"word","title":"יַעֲקֹב","subtitle":"H3290 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Jaakob , the Israelitish patriarch","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to יַעֲקֹב (H3290) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 349 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"יַעֲקֹב (Yaʻăqôb) means Jaakob , the Israelitish patriarch First listed occurrence: 1Chr 16 13."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"יַעֲקֹב","transliteration":"Yaʻăqôb","pronunciation":"yah-ak-obe'","strong":"H3290","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3290","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-m","forms":["יַעֲקֹ֖ב","יַעֲקֹ֔ב","יַעֲקֹ֑ב","יַעֲקֹֽב","יַעֲקֹ֗ב"],"morphs":[["HNp",274],["HR/Np",50],["HC/Np",14],["HC/R/Np",11]]},"definitions":{"short":"Jaakob , the Israelitish patriarch","usage":"Jacob.","full":"H3290. Yaaqob יַּעֲקב 344 , יַעֲקוֺב 5 proper name, masculine and of a people Jacob , Ιακωβ , son of Isaac and Rebekah, father of tribes of Israel (explanation from עָקֵב heel Gen 25:26 ; Hosea 12:4 ; i.e. supplanter ; compare with עָקַב overreach Gen 27:36 ; one closely following according to Lag BN 127 ; connection with Palestinian city (?) called in Egyptian Y±kb'ara (i.e. יַעֲקֹבאֵֿל ) is obscure; compare Mey ZAW vi.1 ff. WMM As.u.Eur.162 ff. Jen ZA x (1895-6), 347 ff.; see also Babylonian proper name, masculine Ya±‡ubilu , Pinches in Hom AHT 61, 96, 112 ; hence OT יַעֲקֹב perhaps originally יעקבקל or the like. compare Palmyrene proper name עתעקב בלעקב, ); — יַעֲקוֺב Jer 30:18 3 t. Jeremiah Lev 26:42 ; יַעֲקֹב 215t. Hexateuch (chiefly J E; 180 t. Genesis, once Leviticus, etc.), 34 t. Psalms, 42 t. Isaiah (27 t. 40-66), etc.; — 1 as proper name, masculine Gen 25:26 205t. (+ יִצְחָק אַבְרָהָם, 19t.); also יַע ׳בֵּית of people (see בַּיִת 5d ( γ )), יַע ׳בְּנֵי (see בֵּן 1j ( β )), יַע ׳זֶרַע (see זֶרַע 4f ), יַע ׳עֵין (see עַיִן ), etc. 2 as proper name, of a people (c. 100 t.; poetry and prophets) Num 24:5 , 19 ; Deut 32:9 ; Psa 44:5 ; Isa 10:21 ; 17:4 ; Jer 10:25 ; 30:7 +; || יִשְׂרָאֵל Num 23:7 ; Deut 33:10 ; Isa 14:1 ; Psa 14:7 + approximately 35 t.; specifically of Northern Israel Amos 7:2 , 5 ; Hosea 12:13 (+ 10:11 ; 12:3 probably, see Now), Micah 1:5 (twice in verse); Isa 9:7 ; of Judah Micah 3:1 , 8 ; Obadiah 10; Isa 65:9 ; Mal 2:12 + al. post-exilic; יַע ׳גְּאוֺן see גָּאוֺן ; יַע ׳אֵל Psa 146:5 , יַע ׳אֱלוֺהַּ 114:7 ; יַע ׳אֱלֹהֵי 2Sam 23:1 ; Isa 2:3 = Micah 4:2 9 t. Psalms + Psa 24:6 ( ׳א ׳יַע for ׳יַע ᵑ0 alone), so ᵑ9 ᵑ6 ᵐ5 Ew Ol Hup Bae We Che and others; read ׳א ׳יַע also probably 2Sam 23:2 (for ׳א ׳יִשׂ , || יִשׂ ׳צוּר ) ᵑ9 HPS; יַע ׳קְדוֺשׁ Isa 29:23 (|| ׳א ׳יִשׂ ); יַע ׳מֶלֶךְ 41:21 (|| יהוה ). — On יַעֲקֹב see especially Dr 'Jacob' in Hastings Dict. Bib. ii. 526 ff .","rootNote":"from 6117 ; heel-catcher (i.e. supplanter);","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 16 13","keyReferences":["1Chr 16 13","1Chr 16 17","1Kgs 18 31","1Sam 12 8","2Kgs 13 23","2Kgs 17 34","2Sam 23 1","Amos 3 13"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":349,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 16 13","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יַעֲקֹ֖ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 17","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/יַעֲקֹב֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Kgs 18 31","book":"1Kgs","chapter":18,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יַעֲקֹ֑ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Sam 12 8","book":"1Sam","chapter":12,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יַעֲקֹ֖ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Kgs 13 23","book":"2Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/יַֽעֲקֹ֑ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"2Kgs 17 34","book":"2Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sour